    "topic_personal_money_intro": "Built for shoppers, employees, and households who need to check a tip, compare a discount or VAT line, convert salary to hourly pay, sketch loan EMIs or debt payoff paths, or understand how compound growth and inflation move purchasing power. Numbers are illustrative; they are not tax, legal, or investment advice.",
    "topic_personal_money_choose_title": "How to pick a money tool",
