    "topic_image_media_choose_body": "Start from the delivery constraint: file weight (compress/optimize), framing (crop/flip/border), format (converter), composition (merge, GIF, watermark), or privacy (EXIF). Color extraction that feeds brand systems may also appear under design-brand. Performance-minded compressors may list secondarily under seo-growth.",
