    "topic_design_brand": "Design & brand",
    "topic_design_brand_title": "Design & brand color tools",
    "topic_design_brand_desc": "Color systems, contrast checks, and brand token helpers for designers and PMs who need accessible palettes and CSS-ready values—not a full design system.",
    "topic_design_brand_blurb": "Color systems, contrast, and brand tokens so design and product teams can ship accessible, consistent UI colors.",
    "topic_design_brand_intro": "For designers, front-end engineers, and PMs aligning brand color with accessibility. Use these when you need contrast ratios, palette structure, or exportable tokens—not when you need full Figma component libraries.",
