    "topic_design_brand_limits_title": "Boundaries",
    "topic_design_brand_limits_body": "WCAG contrast is necessary but not sufficient for readability (font size, weight, and ambient light matter). Brand guidelines may impose trademark colors that fail contrast—document exceptions with legal/design leads. These tools do not replace user testing.",
